      "writtenOn": "2020-10-08T18:41:08Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This makes a board without a battery or with a depleted battery reboot after shutdown to G3 because AP_OFF would be lost. I\u0027m not sure how much we care about this corner case of the corner case. Anyway, it\u0027s not a clear winner...",
      "parentUuid": "a179c32b_6d8419f4",
      "revId": "89e5cc2debe6ccfb9f41256dcf2fe1a62fda0e9a",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
